    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote1" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Chain of ownership:</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>PAA GP Holdings LLC - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Plains GP Holdings, L.P. - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Plains All American GP LLC - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Plains AAP, L.P. - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>PAA GP LLC - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Plains All American Pipeline, L.P. - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Plains GP LLC - TX</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Plains Pipeline, L.P. - TX</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value1" xlink:to="footnote1" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="1" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote2" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Chain of ownership:</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Delek US Holdings, Inc. - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Delek US Energy Inc. - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Delek Logistics Services Company - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Delek Logistics GP, LLC - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Delek Logistics Partners, LP - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Delek Logistics Operating, LLC - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>DKL Pipeline, LLC - DE</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value2" xlink:to="footnote2" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="2" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote3" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Red River Pipeline Company LLC is managed by its Members, who act through a Board. Each Member appoints one Board Member to act on its behalf and one alternate Board Member who can act in the Board Member's place. The Board Members are listed on page 105.</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>The Board may designate and appoint one or more persons to serve as Officers of the Company with the authority to perform such duties as delegated by the Board. The Designated Officers are listed on page 104.</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value3" xlink:to="footnote3" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="3" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote8" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Current year distributions were $45,997,000, which exceeded the positive balance in unappropriated retained income by $13,840,438 as of December 31, 2025. Such excess was recorded against additional paid-in capital.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value8" xlink:to="footnote8" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="8" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote9" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Current year distributions were $45,997,000 which exceeded the positive balance in unappropriated retained income by $13,840,438 as of December 31, 2025. Such excess was recorded against additional paid-in capital.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value9" xlink:to="footnote9" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="9" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote11" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The segment of Red River which runs from Cushing, Oklahoma to Hewitt, Oklahoma is operated by Plains Pipeline, L.P. It is owned by Red River Pipeline Company LLC 68.52% and Valero Partners Wynnewood LLC 31.48%.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value11" xlink:to="footnote11" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="11" />
  </link:footnoteLink>
